/*
 * Implements semantic validation for map comprehensions iterating over a tuple.
 *
 * A tuple is iterated at compile time: the pair is validated once per element,
 * and the insertions are unrolled in the constructed map.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::compose::mapfor::tuple
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/compose/mapfor/tuple.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-09-18
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
